      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/17/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:39047b5ac70e94f9f648aadf",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "她虽然看不见未来，\r\n却能看见“别的什么东西”。\r\n而她所“观测”的东西，究竟是……",
      "source_fingerprint": "f9ca06a40e06da89b73065a66d4cffb2555b2e2da5c90b12fb0ba75b7a26fe76",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
