    {
      "uid": "zhcn:eaebd3f5abdd93ac7cbf2f3b",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "新宇宙观测的是——\r\n与自己最为接近的『个体』。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c6d132f34b21a945f252dab9d0ea0b00e5b27a90c06896f8e26e3d14de794e50",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1105/storytimeline_501105316.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
