        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/24/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:052ccd64686725ae36e49ae3",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "这话实在太过突然。突然开口这样说，\r\n任谁都不可能相信吧。\r\n但是……\r\n",
      "source_fingerprint": "ba2d9c317c06e44c51d4ad01e15a00e03c9ee3c75371ebe69ec3e9298fba74ee",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1105/storytimeline_501105316.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        25,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/25/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b2f34f7e4f26c2d30140b48b",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我与新宇宙之间，存在着“联系”。\r\n名为“信赖”的联系。而且——",
      "source_fingerprint": "f0f5806dfde84ccf1c44f0c5abf44f7918a4cd52320b6f2e6d44a00871978f4d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1105/storytimeline_501105316.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        26,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/26/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7f2a484b6adb42d4e2cad2d6",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "实际上——她的说辞也的确有证据支撑。\r\n新宇宙迄今为止已经言中了数次她本绝不可能知\r\n晓的事件。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7a519bc17a836bec9f491894c1f9e21203dc5fae7486c9b4b6688dbbfaad57a8",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1105/storytimeline_501105316.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        27,
        "text"
