    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ee33850970f05e4eb62b4e14",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "新宇宙……不希望变成那样。\r\n所以才希望进行“STRK”。\r\n越过“GATE”——",
      "source_fingerprint": "4d041e1a239159e904848afe4f9cd27bca6e85f1d44e2887f430aae8ef5028cc",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1105/storytimeline_501105316.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        43,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/43/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4b8a4988958c81f8db07599a",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "新宇宙",
      "source_fingerprint": "f4d688f71d8c38a8a2d9ef98cb402b044f0892dc958bfddf71ec65b7b37fbf2f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1105/storytimeline_501105316.json",
