    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:99fce6a46015ea64c783fd08",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "发生了什么也无从得知，就那么消失了……\r\n如果属实的话，那她自然是想要突破那悲剧的宿\r\n命的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ed77479a276987f8c5cb390e26575ed6e4a3e53595ef4f91603cf40747762214",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1105/storytimeline_501105316.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
