      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/47/choice_data_list/0"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:66735a15444d7f0d32f7df58",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我也开始觉得脊背发凉。\r\n总之，还是先讨论眼下要怎么做吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "549d495241fa6f7aa2df319d350e1304dd68b809c069fe18f87635fde1f419ef",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1105/storytimeline_501105316.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        47,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/47/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0805f1720127bf0852f067b4",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "迄今为止，新宇宙从未选择自既定的道路中逃\r\n脱，而是选择了一步步变得更强，向命运发起\r\n挑战。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5147ac129ed282c719a0bdaa8da5fdb20a69be925dea4f987197cf54fbd460f2",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1105/storytimeline_501105316.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        48,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/48/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2f49cfecb9814760100493db",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "那还是按照她的想法——为了粉碎那个悲剧，\r\n不选择避战，而是保持当前路线并争取拿出最\r\n佳结果为好。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6c4317aee56b7999407c2e07492962771d9fd329387f88cbdbd069030b496a68",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1105/storytimeline_501105316.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        49,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/49/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:678567d73560d013857f315d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "当晚，我与新宇宙来到了一个地方——",
      "source_fingerprint": "f5733251d86381c3cd1a08a527e0fda3026ae47066e491f782c8ea1aff59bc89",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1105/storytimeline_501105316.json",
